<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E signs PLN 73 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E signs PLN 73 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading company Mostostal Export SA signed a 73.2-million-zloty contract with Polish  Globe Trade Center SA to modernise a building in Warsaw, Mostostal said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Mostostal said in a statement that the works would be carried out by April 30, 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
